      <title>✏️ Fall college testing season is here in Arlington ISD! Students and families, here are…</title>
      <description>✏️ Fall college testing season is here in Arlington ISD! Students and families, here are two important testing dates to add to your calendar:

📆 Sept. 30 | ACT School Day
📆 Oct. 7 | PSAT Testing
• PSAT 8/9: Designed for 8th graders
• PSAT 10: Designed for 10th graders
• PSAT/NMSQT: Taken by 10th and 11th graders, with 11th graders eligible for National Merit Scholarship consideration

Students, get a good night’s sleep, arrive at school on time, and come ready to show what you know! Want to Practice? &gt; https://satsuite.collegeboard.org/practice satsuite.collegeboard.org/practice</description>
